<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Your live session is reported in two places. The chat window's own status bar, along its bottom edge, shows what this conversation is doing: an active call or P2P session. The system tray, beside the clock, shows what the machine is doing: who is online from your notify list, how fast the server is answering, and whether sounds are muted."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Your nickname, your identity state and the conversation you are reading are not repeated here — the chat window's title bar names them."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_status}>{dgettext("help_features", "Two Sections")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <strong>{dgettext("help_features", "Left:")}</strong>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Active group call or P2P session, and the online buddy badge."
  )}<br />
  <strong>
    {dgettext("help_features", "Right:")}
  </strong>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Lag indicator, local clock, and mute toggle."
  )}<br />
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
